+# Perf history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+Measured on the adversarial synthetic 30-word vocabulary (Zipf-distributed, high
+term reuse — see the `WORDS` table and `word()` in `crates/muninn-bench/src/main.rs`):
+
+- Before the term-selection fix: full-recall `UserPromptSubmit` hook p95 = **10.27 ms**.
+- Fix: drop terms with `df > n/3` (a term in more than a third of the store carries
+  no signal and costs a long posting list) before IDF top-8 selection — see
+  `crates/muninn-core/src/recall.rs`.
+- After the fix: full-recall `UserPromptSubmit` hook p95 = **1.82 ms**.
+
+Source: project session transcript (muninn trust-1 episode, 2026-09-12/13, session
+14a6ab47). No separate results file with these two numbers was found in this
+worktree; re-running `muninn-bench perf` here to confirm live was not possible
+(cargo build required approval not granted in this session).
